# First bundle

Clone [github.com/koliyo/okmate](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate) and use the
checked-in `knowledge/` directory. That tree is inert OKF Markdown. This
website is Rocdown and is not that bundle.

## Validate

From the repository root:

```sh
okmate check knowledge --profile strict --format terminal
```

`--profile strict` is the owners-and-evidence profile used in this project.

## Inspect and search

```sh
okmate inspect catalog knowledge
okmate inspect concept architecture/system-overview knowledge
okmate search "system overview" knowledge --profile strict
```

`inspect` prints engine JSON. Prefer a concept id or unique filename stem
over loading the whole catalog into a prompt.

## Preview HTML (optional)

```sh
okmate view knowledge --no-window
```

That preview is Askama HTML for the bundle. It is not this product site.
`okmate` does not compile Rocdown.

## Author a record

Add or edit Markdown under `knowledge/` with OKF YAML. Keep the body inert:
no Rocdown declarations. After a substantive edit, run `okmate check` again
on that same root.
